{14}{It's not for someone as lowly as I to know where the First Acolyte spends his time.  I am not to question, only to serve the Church in the best way that I can.  I'm sure he'll be back soon.  Alexander never leaves us alone for long.  [You see admiration in the boy's eyes.]}{It's not for someone as lowly as I to know where the First Acolyte spends his time.  I am not to question, only to serve the Church in the best way that I can.  I'm sure he'll be back soon.  Alexander never leaves us alone for long.  [You see admiration in the boy's eyes.]}{}{}{}{}
